    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using an array of investigative tools, including EVP recorders, spirit boxes, and infrared cameras, you must collect evidence of the paranormal and piece together the tragic history. But beware\u2014the more you uncover, the more hostile the spirits become. Some will try to communicate, others will try to trap you in their eternal torment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chilling narrative-driven experience blending psychological horror and supernatural investigation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use realistic paranormal equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic, unpredictable environments that change as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings, depending on the choices you make and the evidence you uncover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spine-chilling atmosphere with immersive audio design that will keep you on edge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260970/extras/35f87f66528246f52b0007b43eeae458.poster.avif?t=1746883987\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260970/extras/35f87f66528246f52b0007b43eeae458.webm?t=1746883987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260970/extras/35f87f66528246f52b0007b43eeae458.mp4?t=1746883987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The haunted places have a grim past that may be intertwined with dark rituals, tragic deaths, and ancient secrets long buried. Your every move triggers unsettling phenomena\u2014echoes of tortured souls, fleeting shadows, and cryptic whispers that seem to follow your every step. The spirits of the past are restless, and they don\u2019t want you to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260970/extras/31237bb8d752d10ea357e2ecd47dfb9f.poster.avif?t=1746883987\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260970/extras/31237bb8d752d10ea357e2ecd47dfb9f.webm?t=1746883987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260970/extras/31237bb8d752d10ea357e2ecd47dfb9f.mp4?t=1746883987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a portal opens up in front of you, would you go through it?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
